 T L DB Name                     F Leng  S D Remark
 - - -- ------------------------ - ----  - - ---------------------------
*
* --- IDENTIFICATION ---
*
   1 AA COD-PROGRAM              A    4    U PRIMARY KEY
   1 AB NAME-PROGRAM            A   60      OFFICIAL NAME
   1 AC ACRONYM-PROGRAM         A   10  N   ABBREVIATION (E.G. PBF, BPC, PETI)
   1 AD TYPE-PROGRAM            A    1  F D A=ASSISTANCE T=EMPLOYMENT
*                                             P=SOCIAL SECURITY
   1 AE RESPONSIBLE-AGENCY       A   10  N   MDS/MDAS AGENCY CODE
   1 AF CREATION-LAW             A   20  N   LAW OR DECREE NUMBER
   1 AG DT-CREATION              N    8      YYYYMMDD
   1 AH DT-CLOSURE               N    8      YYYYMMDD (0=ACTIVE)
   1 AI STAT-PROGRAM             A    1  F D A=ACTIVE I=INACTIVE E=ENDED
*
* --- BASE AMOUNTS ---
*
   1 BA AMT-BASE-INDIVIDUAL      P  7,2      MONTHLY BASE AMOUNT PER PERSON
   1 BB AMT-BASE-FAMILY          P  7,2      MONTHLY BASE AMOUNT PER FAMILY
   1 BC AMT-CEILING-BENEF        P  9,2      MAXIMUM BENEFIT AMOUNT
   1 BD AMT-FLOOR-BENEF          P  7,2      MINIMUM BENEFIT AMOUNT
   1 BE PCT-ANNUAL-ADJUST        P  3,2  N   ADJUSTMENT PERCENTAGE (E.G. 5,75)
   1 BF DT-LAST-ADJUST           N    8  N   YYYYMMDD
   1 BG FACTOR-K                 P  5,4  N   SPECIAL CORRECTION FACTOR
*                                             >>> UNDOCUMENTED <<<
*                                             INSERTED AUG/2008 BY ADILSON
*                                             "FULFILLS SENARC REQUEST"
*                                             NO FURTHER DETAILS IN THE TICKET
   1 BH FACTOR-ADJUST            P  3,4  N   FACTOR ON BASE AMOUNT (2002)
*
* --- ELIGIBILITY ---
*
   1 CA MAX-PERCAP-INCOME        P  7,2      MAXIMUM PER-CAPITA INCOME
   1 CB AGE-MIN                  N    3      MINIMUM BENEFICIARY AGE (0=NONE)
   1 CC AGE-MAX                  N    3      MAXIMUM BENEFICIARY AGE (0=NONE)
   1 CD IND-REQUIRES-CHILDREN    A    1  F   S/N
   1 CE QTY-MIN-CHILDREN         N    2      MINIMUM CHILDREN (IF CD='S')
   1 CF IND-REQUIRES-SCHOOL      A    1  F   S/N - SCHOOL ATTENDANCE
   1 CG IND-REQUIRES-VACCINE     A    1  F   S/N - VACCINATION RECORD
   1 CH IND-REQUIRES-PRENATAL    A    1  F   S/N - PRENATAL
   1 CI IND-REQUIRES-BIOMETRICS  A    1  F   S/N (REQUIRED FROM 2005)
   1 CJ COD-ELIGIBILITY          A    5  N D SEE TICKET 4471/2012
*
* --- CALCULATION RULES (PERIODIC GROUP - MAX. 5 BANDS) ---
*
 P 1 DA GRP-CALC-BAND                    (1:5) CALCULATION BANDS
   2 DB INCOME-START             P  7,2  N   INCOME BAND START
   2 DC INCOME-END               P  7,2  N   INCOME BAND END
   2 DD FACTOR-MULTIPLIER        P  3,4  N   FACTOR ON BASE AMOUNT
   2 DE AMT-ADDITIONAL           P  7,2  N   ADDITIONAL FIXED AMOUNT
   2 DF IND-ACCUM                A    1  F   S=ACCUMULATES WITH PREVIOUS BAND
*
* --- APPLICABLE DISCOUNT TYPES (MU - MAX. 8) ---
*
 M 1 EA TYPE-DISC-APPLIC          A    3  N   (1:8) VALID DISCOUNT TYPES
*                                             IR=IRRF JD=COURT-ORDERED
*                                             CS=PAYROLL-DEDUCTED PA=ALIMONY
*                                             EM=LOAN TX=FEE
*                                             OU=OTHER EX=EXTRAORDINARY
*
* --- REGIONAL PARAMETERS (PERIODIC GROUP - 5 REGIONS + SPECIAL) ---
*
 P 1 FA GRP-REGIONAL-PARAM                   (1:6) REGIONAL PARAMETER
*                                             1=N 2=NE 3=CO 4=SE 5=S 6=ESP
   2 FB COD-REGION               A    2  N   01-05 OR 99
   2 FC FACTOR-REGIONAL          P  3,4  N   REGIONAL MULTIPLIER
   2 FD AMT-REG-COMPLEMENT       P  7,2  N   FIXED REGIONAL SUPPLEMENT
   2 FE IND-ACTIVE-REGION        A    1  F   S/N
*
* --- CONTROL ---
*
   1 GA DT-INSERT                N    8      YYYYMMDD
   1 GB USR-INSERT               A    8  N
   1 GC DT-LAST-UPDATE           N    8  N   YYYYMMDD
   1 GD USR-LAST-UPDATE          A    8  N
*
* --- DERIVED DESCRIPTORS ---
*
 S   S2 SUPER-TYPE-STAT           A    2    S
        /* AD(1-1), AI(1-1)
*
* COLUMN LEGEND
*   T  = TYPE      (BLANK)=ELEMENTARY  G=GROUP  M=MULTIPLE-VALUE
*                  P=PERIODIC GROUP    S=DERIVED DESCRIPTOR
*   L  = LEVEL     1=ROOT FIELD  2=FIELD WITHIN GROUP/PE
*   DB = SHORT NAME - 2-BYTE PHYSICAL NAME IN THE FDT
*   F  = FORMAT    A=ALPHA  N=UNPACKED NUMERIC  P=PACKED DECIMAL
*   LENG           BYTES OR DIGITS,DECIMALS (EX. 9,2)
*   S  = STORAGE   N=NULL SUPPRESSION  F=FIXED STORAGE
*   D  = DESCRIPTOR D=DESCRIPTOR U=UNIQUE S=SUPER H=HYPER P=PHONETIC
*   /* LINE BELOW A DERIVED DESCRIPTOR = FIELDS THAT COMPOSE IT
*
* TOTAL FIELDS: 41 ELEMENTARY + 2 GROUPS + 1 DERIVED DESCRIPTOR
* RECORD SIZE: UNCOMPRESSED 361 BYTES (PE AND MU FULLY POPULATED)
*              COMPRESSED     ~230 BYTES (ADACMP RATE 36%)
* ESTIMATED RECORDS: 45 (ADAREP 14/03/2018)
* TOP-ISN 48   MAXISN 500   ISN REUSE: ON
* DATA USAGE: NEGLIGIBLE (LESS THAN 1 CYLINDER)
*
